# Living Documentation Procedure

Status: DONE
Milestone: D1 Procedure definition; execution recurs with every relevant change
Dependencies: None
Execution status: IN_PROGRESS

## Purpose

Keep the source-linked engineering book, diagrams, synthetic UI illustrations and public journal
accurate as the implementation evolves. Workstream38 completion does not retire this procedure.

## Inputs

Authorized change scope, affected source, current primary contracts/chapters, synthetic image
fixtures, prior edition manifest and public evidence. See docs\DOCUMENTATION-MAINTENANCE.md.

## Procedure

1. Identify changed behavior and corresponding chapters/contracts before editing source.
2. Update explanations, defaults, examples, error paths and precise path/line citations from source.
3. Refresh diagrams when data flow, state, ownership or trust boundaries change. Label plans clearly.
4. Regenerate affected UI images with Export-HandbookScreenshots.ps1; inspect synthetic content,
   device labels and provenance. Never capture user notes, desktop, chats or real audio.
5. Append significant decisions, corrections and evidence to root JOURNAL.md and the TODO ledger.
6. Run existing documentation parser tests if tooling changes; keep ps1/txt script twins identical.
7. Read and update affected source-atlas annotations, source hashes and contiguous line partitions;
   add newly discovered first-party files. Run tools\Docs\source-atlas.mjs to build its complete
   HTML/PDF companion before the handbook. Do not inflate coverage by counting mirrors as new logic.
8. Review changed source against prose, then build the complete HTML/PDF edition with
   Build-Handbook.ps1 -AcceptReviewedSource. Use -NoPdf only for intermediate editing.
9. Inspect changed rendered pages/images, resolve missing links/diagrams/layout and run -Check.
10. Record actual evidence and limitations in the feature task/index. Persist only designated context.

## Stop conditions

Unknown source behavior, invalid citation/link, stale image/source hash, rendering failure,
private-content fixture, misleading qualification claim or missing PDF in a final book milestone.
Do not overwrite a hash to bless stale pixels or use a hosted renderer as a shortcut.

## Outputs

Updated primary contracts/chapters/diagrams, synthetic image provenance where relevant, dated
journal/ledger entry, full local HTML/PDF and current manifest. No publication is implied.

